      "detailed_description": "What is Mimic Logic?<br />\r\nA procedurally generated roguelike logic puzzle game where you can speak to treasure boxes.<br />\r\nListen to what the boxes have to say, find the lying Mimics, and open up the remaining boxes to collect treasure!<br />\r\nIf you accidentally open up a Mimic, it's game over!<br />\r\nUse the gear and items you've collected from treasure boxes to beat enemies and conquer the dungeon.<br />\r\nThe puzzles are procedurally generated, so you can solve them to your heart's content!",
